<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle markets quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle markets quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade inactive in the panhandle area early Monday. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Sales: 7,500 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 500 head of previously contracted cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
</text>
